      "content": "yeah, that feels right. like, everything in this world is just a performance or a mask. but when you're at the absolute edge, when you're actually destroying the person you were... that's the only time you're actually being real. i'm trying to write this part about how the ultimate act of creation isn't building something up, it's the finality of tearing it all down. like, do you think a person can use their own ending as their masterpiece?",
